{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "5260d9a3-0a43-44e6-861f-18d23013ff2f",
    "name": "ms-batch-producer, ms-event-consumer y ms-monitoreo",
    "description": "Flujo A → Kafka → B. Seleccionar archivo en Body/form-data/file de la subida. La colección captura jobExecutionId/uploadId. C (8083) consulta conteos globales y tiempos de ingestión A. No requiere Environment adicional. Ejecutar reinicio solo para jobs FAILED/STOPPED.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "producerBaseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "URL de A; cambiar si publicas otro puerto."
    },
    {
      "key": "consumerBaseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8081",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "URL de B; cambiar si publicas otro puerto."
    },
    {
      "key": "jobExecutionId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Se completa después de subir o reiniciar una carga."
    },
    {
      "key": "uploadId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Identificador de la carga; se captura automáticamente."
    },
    {
      "key": "jobStatus",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Último estado recibido."
    },
    {
      "key": "metricName",
      "value": "jvm.memory.used",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Nombre de métrica Actuator a consultar."
    },
    {
      "key": "monitorBaseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8083",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "URL del servicio C"
    },
    {
      "key": "page",
      "value": "0",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Página desde cero"
    },
    {
      "key": "size",
      "value": "25",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Tamaño entre 1 y 100"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Servicio A · Cargas batch",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Subir XML o ZIP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{producerBaseUrl}}/api/batch/launch",
              "host": [
                "{{producerBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "batch",
                "launch"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Selecciona Body → form-data → file → Select Files y elige el XML o ZIP local. No agregues Content-Type manualmente. Devuelve 202 y guarda jobExecutionId/uploadId en las variables de esta colección. Una nueva subida crea una carga nueva.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": null,
                  "description": "Selecciona tu XML o ZIP mediante Select Files. El campo ya está preparado; no es necesario eliminarlo ni volver a crearlo."
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Solicitud aceptada\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(202); });",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 202) {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.test(\"Respuesta contiene identificadores\", function () { pm.expect(data.jobExecutionId).to.be.a(\"number\"); pm.expect(data.uploadId).to.be.a(\"string\"); });",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"jobExecutionId\", String(data.jobExecutionId));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"uploadId\", data.uploadId);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"jobStatus\", data.status);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Consultar última carga",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{producerBaseUrl}}/api/batch/jobs/{{jobExecutionId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{producerBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "batch",
                "jobs",
                "{{jobExecutionId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Ejecuta primero la subida o configura jobExecutionId manualmente. COMPLETED indica que A terminó la ingestión; pendingEvents=0 indica publicación en Kafka, no finalización de B. Esta consulta no proporciona el conteo de PROCESSED de B."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Consulta exitosa\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"jobStatus\", data.status);",
                  "    if (data.uploadId) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"uploadId\", data.uploadId);",
                  "    pm.test(\"Estado de ejecución presente\", function () { pm.expect(data.status).to.be.a(\"string\"); });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Reiniciar carga FAILED o STOPPED",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{producerBaseUrl}}/api/batch/jobs/{{jobExecutionId}}/restart",
              "host": [
                "{{producerBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "batch",
                "jobs",
                "{{jobExecutionId}}",
                "restart"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Ejecutar individualmente solo si el job está FAILED o STOPPED. Conserva uploadId y continúa desde el checkpoint. Guarda el nuevo jobExecutionId para las consultas posteriores. No usar para jobs COMPLETED ni como acción rutinaria."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Solicitud aceptada\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(202); });",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 202) {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.test(\"Respuesta contiene identificadores\", function () { pm.expect(data.jobExecutionId).to.be.a(\"number\"); pm.expect(data.uploadId).to.be.a(\"string\"); });",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"jobExecutionId\", String(data.jobExecutionId));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"uploadId\", data.uploadId);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"jobStatus\", data.status);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
